// A failed fork marks the auto job error.
// A queued job stays queued. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE fork ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG fork law

IMPULSE fork 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "fork" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
